config USB_DC_WB32
    bool "Westberry WB32 USB device controller"
    default y
    depends on DT_HAS_WESTBERRY_WB32_USB_ENABLED
    depends on USB_DEVICE_STACK
    help
      Legacy usb_dc driver for the WB32FQ95 indexed full-speed controller.
      Supports EP0 and three bidirectional bulk or interrupt endpoints with
      maximum packets of 64 bytes. Isochronous and remote wakeup are unsupported.
